: 1.4-inch AMOLED full touch screen\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eResolution: 360 x 360 pixels\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eSensors: Heart rate monitor, SpO2 monitor, accelerometer, gyroscope\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCompatibility: iOS and Android\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStrap Material: Silicone (interchangeable)\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eDimensions: 46 x 38 x 11 mm\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eConnectivity: Bluetooth 5.0\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eBattery Life: Up to 7 days\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWater Resistance: IP68 rating\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWeight: 40g\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch2\u003eWhy Choose the Pixel SmartWatch?\u003c\/h2\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eChoosing the Pixel Smartwatch means opting for a device that seamlessly integrates into your life. Its comprehensive features, high-quality build, and stylish design make it a standout choice.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eWhether you're tracking your fitness, staying connected, or simply enhancing your style, the Pixel Smartwatch delivers. Plus, our dedicated customer support ensures you have a smooth experience from purchase to everyday use.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"ZeroLifestyle.co","offers":[{"title":"Rainbow Gold","offer_id":48544548913430,"sku":"20449","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Golden","offer_id":48543732826390,"sku":"20153","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Silver","offer_id":48543732760854,"sku":"20154","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false},{"title":"Black","offer_id":48543732728086,"sku":"20152","price":7999.0,"currency_code":"PKR","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0722\/8106\/3702\/files\/3_1_-1.png?v=1717406207"},{"product_id":"delta-smartwatch","title":"Delta Smartwatch","description":"\u003cp\u003eStyle up the smarter side of life with the Delta Smartwatch, featuring the largest 2.04” HD Curved Display in Smartwatches. Powered by a 3D Curved Smart Display and a